4 bedroom penthouse/penthouse flat with garage and balcony for sale in Matosinhos Sul - Porto.

Discover this Premium 4 bedroom flat in Matosinhos Sul | Ready to move in | A few minutes from the beach

Discover this elegant 4 bedroom flat located in one of the most valued and sought-after areas of Greater Porto Matosinhos Sul. Ready to move in, this property combines comfort, modernity and a privileged location, ideal for those looking for quality of life by the sea.

Inserted in a residential area of excellence, it is just a 7-minute walk from the Marginal and Praia de Matosinhos, practically in front of the Porto City Park, also benefiting from excellent road access and proximity to shops, services, metro and schools.

With contemporary lines and high quality finishes, the flat stands out for its large spaces, natural light and functional organisation of the interior areas, complemented by pleasant private outdoor spaces.

Key features:

Large and bright living room with access to a fantastic balcony;

Fully equipped modern kitchen;

4 bedrooms with excellent areas and built-in wardrobes;

Bathrooms with suspended sanitary ware;

Multilayer oak wood flooring;

Lacquered aluminium frames with high thermal and acoustic performance;

LG Deluxe multi-split AC climate control;

Ceilings with integrated lighting;

Parking space and storage.

Excellent location:

Living in Matosinhos Sul is to enjoy a unique lifestyle between the sea and the city. A few minutes away you will find:

Matosinhos Beach;

Porto City Park;

Foz do Douro;

Restaurants, commerce and services;

Gymnasiums, schools and hospitals;

Metro station 5 minutes walk away;

Quick access to the A28, A4 and Ring Road.

Ideal for own housing or safe investment in one of the locations with the highest demand and appreciation in the Porto region.

